            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Right ⌘ pastes again when you are quick

After a screenshot, switching to another app now takes away the **right ⌘
to mark up** note, so right ⌘ opens Cubby as usual. Screenshot, ⌘-Tab to
your message, right ⌘, and paste it, with no editor getting in the way.
Stay where you are and tap right ⌘, and the shot still opens ready to draw
on.
]]></description>
